It's the Holidays. And you know what that means...

Everything is on sale!

That's right my friend, every coaching program and resource
on CompleteTrackandField.com is on sale this week.

http://completetrackandfield.com/holiday-sale/

Quick story:

This past weekend I went to watch a meet at Brown University.
It was strange to be at a meet where I didn't have any dogs in
the fight. I was just a spectator. So I wasn't running around
crazy, completely dialed into what my athletes were doing on
the track and in the field.

(Or on a rampage because of what they were not doing.)

During the few hours I was at this small, random, early season
Invitational, I must have had a solid 10 college and high school
coaches, parents and athletes approach me and mention something
about how they and/or their athletes have benefited from the
information and resources available at Complete Track & Field.

Not only was it humbling to get a sense of how many people have
been positively impacted by the information we provide, but it
was frightening.

I'm serious.

I'm a hardcore track nerd and competitive to a fault. I'm
constantly trying to learn and apply new information in order
to evolve my programs and get more out of my athletes.

But so are a lot of other coaches.

I used to think winning at the high school level was pretty easy

because the majority of high school coaches don't know what they're
talking about. And that's still true.

But the masses aren't who you have to worry about.
Instead, it's the coaches like you and I who are trying to score
points and win championships. They're the ones who are going to
take advantage of this sale. They're the ones whose athletes you
have to deal with during Championship Season.

So don't let your hurdle game slide this season because the good
coaches won't. Don't be lazy in the jumps this year because,
believe me, good coaches are all over Boo Schexnayder's horizontal
jumps program. Don't neglect the weight room or strength training
because your athletes can't get faster if they're not getting
stronger.

The truth is that most coaches won't invest in a single new
resource this season. And they won't take advantage of this
sale.

But, you probably don't consider yourself like most people.

So don't be like most coaches.

http://completetrackandfield.com/holiday-sale/


To your success,

Coach Thomas
Track & Field Association



P.S. - Save 25% on any of our track and field resources until Friday.
Grab a program today, your athletes will thank you later:

http://completetrackandfield.com/holiday-sale/

